      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783026606456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Correctness Guarantees\n\n1. Business mutation + audit outbox commit together\n2. Duplicate event_id writes are ignored\n3. Immutable archive is source of truth\n4. Query index is rebuildable\n5. Reads always scoped by tenant_id\n6. Hash chain detects mutation/removal\n7. Exports are logged as audit events",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e45",
      "originalText": "Correctness Guarantees\n\n1. Business mutation + audit outbox commit together\n2. Duplicate event_id writes are ignored\n3. Immutable archive is source of truth\n4. Query index is rebuildable\n5. Reads always scoped by tenant_id\n6. Hash chain detects mutation/removal\n7. Exports are logged as audit events",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 17
    },
